{"ro": {"1": ["Alt cimitir de nave...", "Stai. Ochiul... vede ceva.", "Semnalul vine de aici. Dupa 300 de ani!", "Ecoul... e real."], "2": ["Ce-i asta?!", "O harta... sparta in bucati.", "Sapte fragmente. Sapte lumi.", "Cine a trimis asta...?", "Merg sa le gasesc pe toate."], "3": ["Iar ai stricat motorul, capitane?", "Nu l-am stricat. L-am... testat.", "Drona, scaneaza avaria!", "Bip-bip!", "Imi datorezi una, Kael.", "Hei! Sunt pilot, nu mecanic!", "Taci si tine cheia.", "Bine ai venit in echipaj, Nyra.", "Gata! Merge mai bine ca noua."], "4": ["Ce e matahala aia?!", "Un recuperator... vrea epava noastra!", "Tine-te bine!", "Nu ne ia nimic. Foc!", "Kael, scutul cedeaza!"], "5": ["AAARGH!", "Cine indrazneste?!", "Usor, uriasule. Suntem de partea ta.", "Arati de parca ai nevoie de un tunar.", "Atunci zburam impreuna, capitane!"], "6": ["Nu misca.", "O miscare si esti istorie, pilotule.", "Cine esti?", "Cineva care cauta acelasi semnal.", "Amintirile mele... nu sunt ale mele.", "Te ajut. Dar raspunsurile sunt ale mele."], "7": ["Pamantul... se misca?!", "Nu e pamant. E O NAVA!", "Zeci de epave... unite intr-una!", "REGELE EPAVELOR.", "Ne priveste pe noi...", "Toata lumea la posturi!", "Asta e pentru Ecou!"], "8": ["Acum!", "Drone, atac!", "LAVA!", "Tinta blocata.", "E prea puternic!", "Impreuna! Pe trei!", "FOC!"], "9": ["Primul fragment...", "Kael, ce scrie acolo?", "Anul... 2065?", "Un mesaj din viitor?!", "Imposibil...", "Si cineva ne urmareste."]}, "en": {"1": ["Another ship graveyard...", "Wait. My eye... it sees something.", "The signal comes from here. After 300 years!", "The Echo... is real."], "2": ["What is this?!", "A map... broken into pieces.", "Seven fragments. Seven worlds.", "Who sent this...?", "I'm going to find them all."], "3": ["Broke the engine again, captain?", "I didn't break it. I... tested it.", "Drone, scan the damage!", "Beep-beep!", "You owe me one, Kael.", "Hey! I'm a pilot, not a mechanic!", "Hush and hold the wrench.", "Welcome to the crew, Nyra.", "Done! Better than new."], "4": ["What is that monster?!", "A salvager... it wants our wreck!", "Hold on!", "It takes nothing from us. Fire!", "Kael, the shield is failing!"], "5": ["AAARGH!", "Who dares?!", "Easy, big guy. We're on your side.", "Looks like you need a gunner.", "Then we fly together, captain!"], "6": ["Don't move.", "One move and you're history, pilot.", "Who are you?", "Someone chasing the same signal.", "My memories... aren't mine.", "I'll help you. But the answers are mine."], "7": ["The ground... is moving?!", "It's not ground. It's a SHIP!", "Dozens of wrecks... fused into one!", "THE GRAVE KING.", "It's looking at us...", "Everyone to your posts!", "This one's for the Echo!"], "8": ["Now!", "Drones, attack!", "LAVA!", "Target locked.", "It's too strong!", "Together! On three!", "FIRE!"], "9": ["The first fragment...", "Kael, what does it say?", "The year... 2065?", "A message from the future?!", "Impossible...", "And someone is watching us."]}}